  "Changes": [
    "PDF417 stores scanline runs in 16-bit arrays when the line length permits, and retains 32-bit widths for longer lines. More tilted lines fit within the same 8 MiB estimated cache allowance; entry count remains bounded. Search order, acceptance rules, cancellation and deadlines are unchanged."
